                    {
                        "sense_id": "cbe33f99-9920-39a7-8cce-cdb4dcb9a496",
                        "entry_id": "cf7a84a4-f78f-3b70-848b-bc3e8f56732d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "thunderstorm"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f8cfee4a-223c-4121-9a05-b77589c2eb81",
                                "sense_id": "cbe33f99-9920-39a7-8cce-cdb4dcb9a496",
                                "text": "грозова́я ту́ча",
                                "translation": "storm cloud; thundercloud",
                                "english": "storm cloud; thundercloud"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b318e0d2-71cf-46ff-8381-d7f296293e4c",
                                "sense_id": "cbe33f99-9920-39a7-8cce-cdb4dcb9a496",
                                "text": "День был ле́тний, ду́шный и зно́йный. Нигде́ ни о́блака. Синева́ не́ба по края́м сгуща́лась до того́, что глаз принима́л её за грозову́ю ту́чу.",
                                "translation": "It was a summer day, close and sultry. Not a cloud anywhere. The blue of the sky was so thick and dark on the horizon that the eye mistook it for storm-cloud.",
                                "english": "It was a summer day, close and sultry. Not a cloud anywhere. The blue of the sky was so thick and dark on the horizon that the eye mistook it for storm-cloud."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
